NoSQL and Advanced Data Models
•	Data Model: JSON/BSON Document Model in MongoDB to support unstructured and dynamic patient clinical timelines.
•	Sample Structure:
•	{
•	  "PatientID": 1045,
•	  "Facility": { "Name": "GH R", "LGA": "RIYOM" },
•	  "Demographics": { "Sex": "F", "Age": 50 },
•	  "ClinicalTimeline": [
•	    {
•	      "PickupDate": "2026-02-02",
•	      "Status": "Active",
•	      "Weight": 46.0,
•	      "ViralLoad": 873.0
•	    }
•	  ]
•	}
•	Suitability: Document modeling allows nesting longitudinal lab test histories inside single patient documents, 
eliminating expensive SQL joins during fast retrieval on clinical dashboards.
